flushwhy in https://github.com/flushwhy/fe/pull/28\n* docs: polish v0.4.0 onboarding and install instructions by @flushwhy in https://github.com/flushwhy/fe/pull/29\n* build: publish SHA-256 checksums with release assets by @flushwhy in https://github.com/flushwhy/fe/pull/30\n* test: cover template resolution failure paths by @flushwhy in https://github.com/flushwhy/fe/pull/31\n* chore(master): release 0.4.0 by @flushwhy in https://github.com/flushwhy/fe/pull/17\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/flushwhy/fe/compare/v0.3.2...v0.4.0","mentions_count":1}